  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Corredores de Transporte Estado Paran</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Transport Corridors State of Parana</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PROGRAM IS DESIGNED TO PRESERVE THE EXISTING PAVED ROADS IN PARANA WHICH ARE PART OF THE MAIN TRANSPORT CORRIDORS, REDUCE THE COST OF TRANSPORT OF GOODS AND IMPROVE THE ROAD SAFETY. WITH THE PROGRAM WOULD BE REHABILITATED 1300 KM AND RESEALED 1000 KM OF ROADS, INCLUDING A COMPONENT TO IMPROVE THE PAVED ROADS MANAGEMENT.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
